        <mxCell id="note1" value="Colors = layers (a layer only calls the one below it)&#10;Blue: HTTP. Receives requests, sends JSON, turns errors into responses&#10;Purple: the shapes of requests and responses, with their validation&#10;Green: the rules (login, sessions, registration)&#10;Yellow: database access (interface, MySQL version, in-memory version)&#10;Grey: start-up, settings, plain data&#10;Red: errors&#10;&#10;Not drawn, to keep it readable: every layer may throw the red errors, and&#10;handlers use the purple records. BaseHandler catches all errors in one place." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="950" width="640" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
